# Cloudflare Pages Headers
# Enables SharedArrayBuffer / multi-threaded WASM while keeping third-party CDNs (Google Fonts, jsDelivr, Hugging Face) working via credentialless COEP.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

# Vite outputs content-hashed files in /assets — safe for 1-year immutable edge caching
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
